# Curated, low-noise check set: guards that are green across the owned
# runtime sources and fail on regressions — dead stores, unused bindings,
# missing overrides, redundant member init. Deliberately NOT a style
# config (formatting stays with the house style; clang-format is not
# wired). Scope rules live in tools/check_clang_tidy.sh: src/runtime
# first-generation files only, never generated_bios/ (recompiler output)
# and never vendor/ (raygui).
---
Checks: >
  -*,
  clang-analyzer-deadcode.DeadStores,
  misc-unused-parameters,
  misc-unused-using-decls,
  misc-unused-alias-decls,
  modernize-use-override,
  readability-redundant-member-init
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*'
